WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.135 --> 00:00:06.702
Yousif (to judges) — Jordan’s written report is ready.
The pictures from September are missing. Here’s what
used to slow the handoff.

2
00:00:06.843 --> 00:00:11.136
Craig (click cue) — In the earlier prototype, Maya
first clicked Prepare transfer brief.

3
00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:16.121
Craig (click cue) — Then she clicked Sign and send to
nurse. Only then did Jordan appear in Riley’s inbox.

4
00:00:16.427 --> 00:00:20.160
Craig (click cue) — Craig, open the numbered guide.
Click one to sign in as Riley.

5
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:22.113
Craig (click cue) — Click two to open Jordan Vale.

6
00:00:22.254 --> 00:00:28.169
Yousif (to judges) — Today the nurse already owns the
check. Nobody had to mark the image pending or forward
a task to Riley.

7
00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:31.360
Craig (click cue) — Open View imaging status, then
View request.

8
00:00:31.501 --> 00:00:38.770
Yousif (to judges) — The checklist and the archive
agree on which earlier study is missing. A local rule
has already requested it from Imaging Records.

9
00:00:39.052 --> 00:00:42.579
Craig (click cue) — Open Jordan’s Summary and point to
a source link under a finding.

10
00:00:42.719 --> 00:00:48.630
Yousif (to judges) — The local parser turns this
packet into a short summary. You can trace each
finding back to the chart.

11
00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:51.750
Yousif (to judges) — Optional AI can rank these
verified findings.

12
00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:56.752
Craig (click cue) — Open Ontology. Select the earlier
X-ray finding to trace it to the request.

13
00:00:56.892 --> 00:01:04.765
Yousif (to judges) — Follow the connection from the
source, to the missing image, to the request. Local
rules create the request and assign Riley’s check.

14
00:01:05.052 --> 00:01:10.195
Craig (click cue) — Return to Jordan in Riley’s inbox.
Click three, Sign and send report to doctor.

15
00:01:10.335 --> 00:01:15.636
Yousif (to judges) — Riley sends today’s written
report to Avery while Imaging Records tracks down the
older picture.

16
00:01:15.927 --> 00:01:17.775
Craig (click cue) — Click four to sign in as Avery.

17
00:01:17.915 --> 00:01:19.646
Craig (click cue) — At five, open Jordan.

18
00:01:19.786 --> 00:01:22.480
Craig (click cue) — At six, open Return for
reassignment.

19
00:01:22.621 --> 00:01:26.789
Craig (click cue) — At seven, enter the reason: I’m
covering a higher-priority patient.

20
00:01:26.930 --> 00:01:29.300
Craig (click cue) — Click eight, Return to triage
agent.

21
00:01:29.441 --> 00:01:35.241
Yousif (to judges) — Avery made the decision to return
this review. The next person sees why Jordan needs
coverage.

22
00:01:35.552 --> 00:01:37.713
Craig (click cue) — Click nine to sign in as Maya
Chen.

23
00:01:37.854 --> 00:01:41.488
Craig (click cue) — At ten, choose Doctor Morgan Lee
as the new receiving doctor.

24
00:01:41.629 --> 00:01:43.906
Craig (click cue) — Click eleven, Sign and reassign.

25
00:01:44.047 --> 00:01:52.737
Yousif (to judges) — Maya is our triage agent, the
person coordinating the handoff. She chooses Morgan.
The original report and the open request stay with
Jordan.

26
00:01:53.052 --> 00:01:54.912
Craig (click cue) — Click twelve to sign in as Morgan.

27
00:01:55.052 --> 00:01:57.711
Craig (click cue) — At thirteen, open Jordan in the
inbox.

28
00:01:57.852 --> 00:02:01.080
Craig (click cue) — At fourteen, read the signed
radiology impression.

29
00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:06.783
Yousif (to judges) — These are the radiologist’s
original words. Morgan can check exactly what the
report says.

30
00:02:06.923 --> 00:02:09.083
Craig (click cue) — At fifteen, close the source.

31
00:02:09.224 --> 00:02:11.745
Craig (click cue) — Click sixteen, Sign report review.

32
00:02:11.886 --> 00:02:17.964
Yousif (to judges) — Morgan’s signature records who
reviewed today’s report. The request for September’s
picture stays open.

33
00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:23.782
Craig (click cue) — Switch back to Maya. Open Jordan’s
Documents. There are seven of eight expected files.

34
00:02:23.922 --> 00:02:27.324
Craig (click cue) — Under Demo controls, click
Simulate file arrival.

35
00:02:27.464 --> 00:02:30.508
Craig (click cue) — Point to eight of eight, then open
the earlier X-ray.

36
00:02:30.648 --> 00:02:38.353
Yousif (to judges) — Now all four demo accounts can
open the same picture. We removed two required admin
clicks on this case and kept the doctor’s signature.
